This set of three artificial Christmas trees creates a layered winter forest display with varying heights of ninety, one hundred and twenty, and one hundred and fifty centimetres. The downswept fir silhouette features snow-dusted polyvinyl chloride branch tips for a realistic snowy appearance.

Each tree includes a built-in control button that allows easy switching between eight distinct lighting modes. These modes include steady glow, twinkle, fading, and chasing effects to create a dynamic light show. The LED lights are powered by three AA batteries per tree, which are not included with the product.

The slim bases and compact profiles of these small Christmas trees offer significant space-saving benefits for modern living environments. The three different sizes allow for versatile styling options while minimising the valuable floor space required for decoration.

These Christmas trees easily separate into manageable sections for simple assembly and space-saving storage after the season ends. A sturdy metal base provides stability for each tree, ensuring they remain upright and secure during use. For a fuller visual profile, we highly recommend spending extra time shaping the branches to achieve the desired lush appearance.

Made with flame-retardant PVC tips and snow flocking, these slim Christmas trees offer added safety for indoor and covered outdoor decorations. The IP44 rated battery box provides protection against splashes and dust, enhancing durability in various environmental conditions.
